                        "target_lang_word": "alas",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "alas",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2b9b5e00-cd67-3a88-a466-9e16fbc40e62",
                                        "entry_id": "4b025857-e5c5-3223-a66b-a0c09fa001c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used to express sorrow, regret, compassion, grief, resignation, or disappointment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40a09396-cbf2-47ca-8c01-90a1e4eab7e7",
                                                "sense_id": "2b9b5e00-cd67-3a88-a466-9e16fbc40e62",
                                                "text": "I wanted to catch the last bus home, but alas, I was ten minutes late and had to take a taxi instead."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23aaaacf-93ab-4268-aafa-0ad36ee4666e",
                                                "sense_id": "2b9b5e00-cd67-3a88-a466-9e16fbc40e62",
                                                "text": "Helas I lamente the dull abuſyd brayne\nThe enfatuate fantaſies the wytles wylfulnes\nOf on and hothyr at me that haue dyſdayne"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a471464b-8621-4ab5-9d49-e5de124ea217",
                                                "sense_id": "2b9b5e00-cd67-3a88-a466-9e16fbc40e62",
                                                "text": "Alas poore Yorick, I knew him Horatio, a fellow of infinite Ieſt; of moſt excellent fancy, he hath borne me on his backe a thouſand times: And how abhorred my Imagination is, my gorge riſes at it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84109c8d-1d33-47f2-b759-ca906e6d6223",
                                                "sense_id": "2b9b5e00-cd67-3a88-a466-9e16fbc40e62",
                                                "text": "Standing afarre off for the feare of her torment, saying, Alas, alas, that great citie Babylon, that mighty citie: for in one houre is thy iudgement come."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e5bfc3b-a47e-466c-ab27-170ad7ea4a41",
                                                "sense_id": "2b9b5e00-cd67-3a88-a466-9e16fbc40e62",
                                                "text": "The thorough and shameless commercialism of Sex has alas! been reserved for what is called \"Christian civilization,\" and with it (perhaps as a necessary consequence) Prostitution and Syphilis have grown into appalling evils, accompanied by a gigantic degradation of social standards, and upgrowth of petty Philistinism and niaiserie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "alas",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "67c4e02a-e050-35d3-aab8-5f65bc2f7247",
                                        "entry_id": "8edf4b7b-b1c1-31ab-aae3-416cfb6ef73a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of geological depression which occurs in Yakutia, formed by the subsidence of permafrost."
                                        ],
